  "name": "Cursed!: a lethal curse gets a reminder and waits for its own proof reply",
  "contract": [
    "Issue #10788. A tier 4 curse (Starvation 901871) has a 20 s warning and a reminder 5 s before it",
    "lands. Without the reply to the reminder's time-sync request it is held past its landing time; the",
    "reply releases it. A second curse (Narcolepsy 901841) answered 1 s after its reminder still waits",
    "the full 5 s after the reminder before it lands."
  ],
